<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-FILIPPINI BEATS RAFTER IN ST POELTEN GRAND PRIX FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILIPPINI BEATS RAFTER IN ST POELTEN GRAND PRIX FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ST POELTEN, Austria 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the $425,000 St Poelten Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefiex denotes seeding:</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 7-Patrick Rafter (Australia) 7-6 (7-2) 6-2</p>
</text>
